95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mantle_of_the_Dragonfriend_(Level_25).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mantle_of_the_Dragonfriend_%28Level_25%29.png/420px-Mantle_of_the_Dragonfriend_%28Level_25%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"349\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mantle_of_the_Dragonfriend_%28Level_25%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>The secrets of the dragons of Argonnessen are woven into this cloak's shimmering fabric. It must have been a goodwill gift in times long past. Upon close inspection, the fabric seems to have been cut from a larger article of clothing and re-sewn by modern hands.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817054600\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.167 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3661/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26520/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7715/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n133.33%  198.811     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  149.114      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  149.114      1 -total\n 98.10%  146.281      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 45.56%   67.929      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.80%   66.807      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 43.46%   64.810      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 42.24%   62.988      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.82%   26.569      7 Template:Popup\n 13.03%   19.426      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:33141-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817054600 and revision id 649550. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
